<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96966" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολ-ίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολίς</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put in trim</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολίσας νηὸς πτερά</span>
			<i>drawing in</i> the sail, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				628
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>equip, dress</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ πέπλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Anacreont.</u>
					15.29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαλμάτιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.366f
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stud.Pal.</u>
					22.183.90
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>:— 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστολισμένος δορί</span>
			<i>armed</i> with spear, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				659
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆες σημείοισιν ἐστ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IA</u>
				255
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυμφικῶς ἐστ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				3.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστ. τὴν βασιλικὴν στολήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Es.</u>
					8.15
				</span></i>
			: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστ</span>. <i>in full
				dress</i>, ib. <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Es.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>deck, adorn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς φρένας τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.214
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leo Phil.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολιστής</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.162.9
			</span></i>.</div>
